          "title": "中",
          "content": "<p>国正在变成一个高工资的低增长经济体。</p>\n<p>-- <a href=\"https://www.project-syndicate.org/commentary/global-economic-prospects-bleak-in-2019-by-kaushik-basu-2019-01\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">《世界经济的糟糕状态》</a></p>",
